              },
              "content": "这是——\n{A挠头}我遗失的哪张黑金卡、来着？\n<style=SizeSmall>大抵又是胜利黎明蟹……咳。</style>",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_501501_2122131619_content",
                "value": "这是——\n{A挠头}我遗失的哪张黑金卡、来着？\n<style=SizeSmall>大抵又是胜利黎明蟹……咳。</style>",
                "duration": null,
